DESCRIPTION >
    - `cncf_country_activities.pipe` returns the CNCF collection contributions that belong to one country, for the country report pipes (`cncf_country_*`).
    - A contribution belongs to the country when its contributor is located there, or when it was made through an organization headquartered there.
    - A contributor is located in a country when the country on their profile, or else their location, names it. An organization is headquartered in a country when its country, or else its location, names it. Names are matched by containment, as in `contributors_geo_distribution.pipe`.
    - Reads from `cncf_collection_activities_ds`, so it covers the CNCF collection only.
    - Parameters:
    - `countryCode`: Required ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (e.g., 'FR'), resolved to a country name through `country_mapping`
    - `startDate`: Optional DateTime filter for activities after timestamp (e.g., '2024-01-01 00:00:00')
    - `endDate`: Optional DateTime filter for activities before timestamp (e.g., '2024-12-31 23:59:59')
    - `includeCodeContributions`, `includeCollaborations`, `includeOtherContributions`: Optional booleans inherited from `activityTypes_filtered` (defaults: code contributions only)
    - Response: `memberId`, `organizationId`, `segmentId`, `timestamp`, `memberInCountry`, `organizationInCountry`

TAGS "Report"

NODE cncf_country_name
SQL >
    %
    SELECT country
    FROM country_mapping
    WHERE
        country_code
        = {{
            String(
                countryCode,
                description="ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (e.g. 'FR')",
                required=True,
            )
        }}
    LIMIT 1

NODE cncf_country_period_activities
SQL >
    %
    SELECT memberId, organizationId, segmentId, timestamp
    FROM cncf_collection_activities_ds
    WHERE
        memberId != ''
        AND (type, platform) IN (SELECT activityType, platform FROM activityTypes_filtered)
        {% if defined(startDate) %}
            AND timestamp
            > {{ DateTime(startDate, description="Filter activity timestamp after", required=False) }}
        {% end %}
        {% if defined(endDate) %}
            AND timestamp
            < {{ DateTime(endDate, description="Filter activity timestamp before", required=False) }}
        {% end %}

NODE cncf_country_members
SQL >
    SELECT id
    FROM members_sorted
    WHERE
        id IN (SELECT memberId FROM cncf_country_period_activities)
        AND position(
            upper(coalesce(nullIf(country, ''), location)),
            upper((SELECT country FROM cncf_country_name))
        )
        > 0

NODE cncf_country_organizations
SQL >
    SELECT id
    FROM organizations FINAL
    WHERE
        id IN (SELECT organizationId FROM cncf_country_period_activities)
        AND position(
            upper(coalesce(nullIf(country, ''), location)),
            upper((SELECT country FROM cncf_country_name))
        )
        > 0

NODE cncf_country_activities_result
SQL >
    SELECT
        memberId,
        organizationId,
        segmentId,
        timestamp,
        memberId IN (SELECT id FROM cncf_country_members) AS memberInCountry,
        organizationId IN (SELECT id FROM cncf_country_organizations) AS organizationInCountry
    FROM cncf_country_period_activities
    WHERE memberInCountry OR organizationInCountry
